  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4101.04 “Law enforcement officer” means a law enforcement employee of the department pursuant to RSA 266:1 and RSA 266:1-a.\n\nSource. #4193, eff 12-30-86, EXPIRED 12-30-92\n\nNew. #5628, eff 5-25-93; ss by #6946, eff 2-25-99, EXPIRED: 2-25-07\n\nNew. #8881, INTERIM, eff 5-3-07, EXPIRES: 10-30-07; ss by #9000, eff 9-29-07, EXPIRED: 9-29-15\n\nNew. #11050, INTERIM, eff 3-5-16, EXPIRED: 9-1-16\n\nNew. #11190, eff 9-22-16",
